          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Optional recorded transport claim; it does not authorize a launch or indicate present liveness."
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "Typed original transport metadata retained by startup recovery. State and observation preserve the owner vocabulary from that record; they are not fresh process observations."
    },
